Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.20,0:02:17.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,血雨探花
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.16,0:02:19.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:23.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还是第一次听你这么叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.50,0:02:26.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,感觉如何
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:29.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好像
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:31.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,和别人这么叫我的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.08,0:02:33.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,感觉不太一样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.00,0:02:36.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哪里不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.87,0:02:38.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.12,0:02:40.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,特别珍重
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:43.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别光说我了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.37,0:02:46.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,与君山带我走的新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.66,0:02:48.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.75,0:02:51.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,咳
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.33,0:02:53.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.50,0:02:54.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你就是在与君山
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.83,0:02:56.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,伪装成新郎带我走的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.20,0:03:02.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我没有伪装新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.66,0:03:05.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那你为什么出现在与君山
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.83,0:03:10.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,答案无非两种
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.54,0:03:13.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一 我冲着你去的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.75,0:03:16.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,二 我很闲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.58,0:03:19.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你信哪个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.54,0:03:21.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哪个可信说不上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.87,0:03:23.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过你好像
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:25.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真的很闲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.75,0:03:30.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,说起来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:32.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你跟传说中的不太一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.75,0:03:36.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那太子殿下如何得知
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.00,0:03:39.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我就是血雨探花的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.79,0:03:42.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我百般试探
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.08,0:03:44.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你都滴水不漏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.45,0:03:45.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,必是绝境
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.91,0:03:48.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你又身着红衣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.66,0:03:51.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,无所不知 无所不能 无所畏惧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.62,0:03:56.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,除了那位大家谈之色变的血雨探花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.58,0:03:58.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好像也没有别的人选了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.87,0:04:01.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我可以当你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:03.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是在夸我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.45,0:04:06.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,难道不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.33,0:04:40.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月 你醒啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.83,0:04:43.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是想出来看星星吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:50.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花将军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.66,0:04:54.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小裴将军以后会怎么样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.62,0:04:56.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.20,0:04:58.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过做错了事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.79,0:05:00.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,总还是要接受惩罚的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.50,0:05:02.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其实
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.58,0:05:04.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小裴将军人没那么差
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.08,0:05:05.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.25,0:05:08.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他以前还帮过我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.04,0:05:11.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,虽然刻磨老骂我鬼迷心窍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.87,0:05:13.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可不管他是不是利用我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.29,0:05:15.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,打开城门
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.50,0:05:16.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都是我自己的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.37,0:05:20.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.33,0:05:21.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.54,0:05:30.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花将军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:31.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.50,0:05:34.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.62,0:05:36.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你为什么老是跟我道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.37,0:05:40.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我要拯救苍生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.33,0:05:42.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.04,0:05:45.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这句话是你以前告诉我的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.91,0:05:46.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.54,0:05:48.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,等等 等等 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.16,0:05:54.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.70,0:05:57.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,当真说过这种话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.95,0:05:59.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.08,0:06:00.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有一次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.33,0:06:03.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你问我长大以后想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.58,0:06:04.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.00,0:06:05.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你就说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.87,0:06:17.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我小时候的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.33,0:06:18.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是拯救苍生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.66,0:06:21.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这 这种随口一说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.12,0:06:23.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你记这么清楚做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.33,0:06:26.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可当时花将军说得很认真啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.95,0:06:29.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.91,0:06:31.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我都不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:33.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我记得
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.62,0:06:34.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你还总说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.87,0:06:36.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,做你认为对的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.62,0:06:38.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一切都不能阻挡你的脚步
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.37,0:06:41.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都是什么废话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.41,0:06:45.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不是这样的人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.45,0:06:47.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我是这样的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.87,0:06:50.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我曾以为我做了对的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.37,0:06:52.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可现在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.45,0:06:54.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不知道什么是对的了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.00,0:06:58.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我开城门放敌军
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.16,0:07:00.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,结果我的族人被屠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.95,0:07:02.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我的国家没了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.50,0:07:03.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可若不开城门
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:06.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月人又会去中原与永安人同归于尽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.41,0:07:10.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花将军对我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.25,0:07:12.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但刻磨对我也很好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.62,0:07:15.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,士兵们都很听我的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.29,0:07:17.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可我不仅害死了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.54,0:07:19.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,连死后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:21.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也无法让他们解脱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.54,0:07:24.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花将军
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.70,0:07:26.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我这两百年
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:29.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,简直不知道在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:36.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那我岂不是这八百年都白活了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.83,0:07:38.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花将军
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:40.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你能不能告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.62,0:07:42.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我到底哪里做的不够好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.66,0:07:44.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,究竟是哪一步出了问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.66,0:07:51.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对不起啊 半月
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.87,0:07:55.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这个问题 我以前不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.37,0:07:58.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,现在依然不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.33,0:08:06.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月并不是因为成了凶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.70,0:08:08.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,才被困在半月关
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.87,0:08:11.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,她是自愿留在那里的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.41,0:08:18.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其实小裴将军若想息事宁人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.58,0:08:21.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可以弄个分身下来悄悄清理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.00,0:08:23.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可他为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.66,0:08:27.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一定要以活人投喂那些亡魂呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.95,0:08:29.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,分身的力量会被削弱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.12,0:08:31.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他一次解决不了这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.41,0:08:34.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,反而用活人投喂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:35.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,能更快消解怨气
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:37.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,毕竟在神官看来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:39.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,凡人的性命不如蝼蚁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.95,0:08:43.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,分身的力量都会被削弱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:46.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可你的分身倒挺厉害的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.91,0:08:51.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我这可是如假包换的本尊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.79,0:08:53.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:54.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,本尊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.29,0:09:07.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.70,0:09:10.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你觉得我这张皮不错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.20,0:09:13.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:14.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,非常不错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.62,0:09:16.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:18.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我能看一下你本来的样子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.20,0:09:24.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我只是随口一问
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.66,0:09:25.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你别放在心上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.16,0:09:27.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还是先来吃饭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:31.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.16,0:09:32.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,糊了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.41,0:09:35.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.12,0:09:37.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我还是再做一次
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:39.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,日后有机会再给你看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.54,0:09:41.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也没那么饿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:43.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,今天先休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.83,0:10:11.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你这成天在外的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.70,0:10:13.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,难道鬼界这么清闲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.83,0:10:14.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都不用报到的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.95,0:10:20.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,报什么到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.54,0:10:22.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鬼界各自为政
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.70,0:10:23.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谁也管不着谁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.41,0:10:25.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,况且
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.70,0:10:26.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我是老大
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.95,0:10:27.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谁敢管我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.00,0:10:30.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.79,0:10:34.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我还当你们和上天庭一样统一为事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.70,0:10:37.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们才没那么古板
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.16,0:10:39.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.41,0:10:41.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你见过其他诡王吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:42.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,见过啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.95,0:10:43.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,青鬼戚容呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.20,0:10:46.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那个没品的废物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.75,0:10:48.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,打过个招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.04,0:10:49.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,结果他跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.66,0:10:53.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,肯定不是正常打招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.20,0:10:55.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就正常打招呼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.08,0:10:58.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还顺便得了个血雨探花的称呼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:02.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他这是同你有嫌隙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.37,0:11:04.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.20,0:11:06.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,看他碍眼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.50,0:11:07.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不止我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.29,0:11:08.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,黑水也嫌弃他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.66,0:11:12.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,黑水沉舟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.33,0:11:14.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你跟他很熟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.41,0:11:16.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不熟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.70,0:11:17.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鬼界没几个我熟的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:19.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,毕竟在鬼界
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.95,0:11:20.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不是绝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.00,0:11:22.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没资格和我说话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.79,0:11:25.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们鬼界挺好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.45,0:11:27.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大鬼就这么几只
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:29.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不像天界
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.33,0:11:30.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,神官多到记不住
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.29,0:11:33.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那就别记
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.37,0:11:34.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,浪费脑子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.87,0:11:36.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.45,0:11:37.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,会得罪人的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.00,0:11:43.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这么点儿事就能被得罪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:45.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可见是心胸狭窄的废物了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.66,0:11:55.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月这孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.37,0:11:57.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知什么时候才回来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.87,0:11:59.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,她心里有事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.25,0:12:01.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就随她去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.83,0:12:04.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.00,0:12:09.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:11.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那句话倒真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.20,0:12:12.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哪句
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.50,0:12:15.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我要拯救苍生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.91,0:12:22.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.66,0:12:25.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这句话有什么问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.16,0:12:29.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,傻乎乎的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.75,0:12:34.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,自古以来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:37.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,敢言苍生者就寥寥无几
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.70,0:12:40.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,而其中敢言拯救苍生更难
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.91,0:12:42.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我更敬佩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:48.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那也得做得到才行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.91,0:12:50.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,明知艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.91,0:12:51.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还要去做
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.37,0:12:53.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不是更难能可贵吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.25,0:12:58.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其实我小时候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.66,0:13:00.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,说过更傻的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.16,0:13:01.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.37,0:13:03.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.25,0:13:05.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,很多年以前
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.70,0:13:07.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,曾经有一个人说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.54,0:13:08.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他活不下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.45,0:13:10.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他问我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.83,0:13:11.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,活着
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.91,0:13:14.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,到底是为了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.66,0:13:15.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有什么意义
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.87,0:13:18.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你知道我当时怎么回答的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.79,0:13:19.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么回答的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:26.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.70,0:13:32.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如果不知道要怎样活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:34.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就为了我而活下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.00,0:13:37.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如果你不知道活下去的意义
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:38.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那就把我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.08,0:13:41.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,当成支撑你活下去的理由吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.29,0:13:46.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,当时我到底是怎么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.87,0:13:48.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,现在让我说这种话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.54,0:13:49.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我可再也说不出口了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.41,0:13:53.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,成为某人生存的意义
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.37,0:13:54.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,已经非常沉重了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.29,0:13:57.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,更遑论拯救苍生呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.66,0:14:01.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只是不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.66,0:14:04.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那个人现在怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.83,0:14:09.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,年纪轻轻就敢言拯救苍生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:12.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,虽然勇敢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.66,0:14:13.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,却很愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.70,0:14:15.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.75,0:14:19.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,虽然愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.66,0:14:21.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,却很勇敢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.29,0:14:24.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真是多谢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.00,0:14:25.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.04,0:14:27.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.37,0:14:30.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下对我说这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.04,0:14:32.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不问我接近你有什么目的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.33,0:14:35.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,聚散皆是缘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.95,0:14:36.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你若不想说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:37.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,自然不会说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.54,0:14:39.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就算我赶你走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:41.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你那么神通广大
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.50,0:14:43.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想来不会再换张皮来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.75,0:14:45.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:47.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家都随便点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.12,0:14:48.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,假使
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.79,0:14:50.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我本相不好看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.87,0:14:52.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你还想看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.75,0:14:55.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.66,0:14:59.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,万一我青面獠牙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.41,0:15:00.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,丑如夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:02.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我想看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.54,0:15:05.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,因为我们现在是朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.00,0:15:08.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,既是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.08,0:15:10.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就该坦诚相待
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.33,0:15:12.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你放心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.41,0:15:13.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只要是你真正的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.08,0:15:14.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我一定都
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.37,0:15:20.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.62,0:15:27.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你笑什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.75,0:15:28.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我说得不对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.54,0:15:31.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没有没有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:33.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你说得很有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.12,0:15:34.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好没诚意
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.54,0:15:35.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,算了 睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.75,0:15:41.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,下次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.54,0:15:43.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你若不嫌弃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.16,0:15:45.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我会用真正的样子见你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:48.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要说话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.87,0:15:49.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.95,0:16:06.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.58,0:16:08.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,上天入地
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.79,0:16:11.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你再找不到一个比我更有诚意的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.66,0:18:16.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.25,0:18:17.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.33,0:18:22.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.25,0:18:23.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.16,0:18:27.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你这观里是不是少了点儿东西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:06.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,神像呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.41,0:19:09.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,画画我也会啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.58,0:19:10.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我帮你
